# Bronx 1982: early-80s electro-funk on a TR-808 grid, dead straight. Boom kick,
# snare and handclap together on 2 and 4, a cowbell riff, accented 16th hats, and a
# bass that jumps up the octave (^) under off-beat saw stabs.
#   street beat --pattern examples/patterns/bronx-1982.groove

title   Bronx 1982
bpm     128
key     Em
style   electro
chords  Em | Em | C | D

#         1    2    3    4      1    2    3    4
kick    | x... ..x. ..x. .... | x... ..x. .x.. ..o. |
snare   | .... x... .... x... | .... x... .... x... |
clap    | .... x... .... x... | .... x... .... x.oo |
cowbell | ...o ..o. ..o. o... | ...o ..o. ..oo .... |
hat     | xgog xgog xgog xgog | xgog xgog xgog xgog |
bass    | x.^. x.^. x.^. o.^. | x..o ..^. x..o ..^. |
keys    | ...o .... ..o. .... | ...o .... ..o. .o.. |
